<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1655) <span class="when">Oct 16, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Export a contact sheet of the playlist.</b> File &#8250; Export &#8250; Contact Sheet&#8230; puts the middle frame of every clip in a grid, the same sheet and files as Kura Hub&#8217;s Sheet: a 4K or 8K JPEG, a Nuke script, a Fusion comp and a Photoshop script, with columns, gap, labels and an upload to Kitsu as the sequence thumbnail. Each frame is shown through its own color and the display on screen. Reviewers whose role doesn&#8217;t allow exports don&#8217;t see it.</li>
<li><b>A contact sheet for Kento.</b> The Kento output adds each clip&#8217;s frame as a scene-linear EXR, ungraded, at its own size, with a manifest Kento opens with File &#8250; Import Contact Sheet.</li>
</ul>
